{"id":"wb-6-971","name":"兴国革命旧址","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"兴国革命旧址","text":"兴国革命旧址位于中国江西省兴国县潋江镇及城郊，是第一次国共内战期间中国共产党及红军、苏维埃政府在兴国建设“苏区模范县”所留下的史迹，包括土地革命干部训练班旧址、中国工农红军江西军区旧址（含红军检阅台）、中央兵工厂旧址、江西省第一次工农兵代表大会旧址和长冈乡调查旧址五处，2006年被列为第六批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%85%B4%E5%9B%BD%E9%9D%A9%E5%91%BD%E6%97%A7%E5%9D%80","revisionId":93358912,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93358912","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与所在地一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/13b2de53dfd463f0dd770d9c.jpg","title":"Lianjiang_Academy_-_Chongsheng_Ci_1.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Lianjiang_Academy_-_Chongsheng_Ci_1.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/0c/Lianjiang_Academy_-_Chongsheng_Ci_1.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Sino Yu","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​潋江书院内的崇圣祠，也是毛泽东传达中共“六大”会议精神并主办土地革命干部训练班旧址。","width":320,"height":180}}